      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "COLD OPEN",
      "estimated_duration_s": 8.0,
      "narration_text": "A breast cancer patient's tumor tests HER2-low. One drug is approved for it. The other is not. Both drugs carry the exact same HER2-targeting antibody. So what's actually different?",
